# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every OS (Godot's default too). Godot, dotnet, Python and
# PowerShell 7 and 5.1 all read LF. Keep .ps1 and .psm1 files ASCII, comments included: Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads
# a script without a BOM in the ANSI code page.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe misreads labels and GOTO in LF-only batch files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Hunk headers in diffs name the enclosing C# member or Markdown heading.
*.cs diff=csharp
*.md diff=markdown

# Binary formats: never converted, diffed or merged as text. Most are ignored (.gitignore); this covers files that are
# allow-listed or force-added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.tga binary
*.dds binary
*.exr binary
*.ico binary
